    "scenesThatPass": [
      "STELLA: If we can last till daylight’s back -- they didn’t show up till sundown. Maybe they can’t stand the light. It’s only two and a half weeks --\nDENISE: Yeah, that’s all.",
      "STELLA: Not anymore.\nDENISE: She spoke to us. In English. Was she some girl they just turned -- or one of them? Does anybody recognize her?",
      "DENISE: All right, Helen!\nSTELLA: I can run for her place -- let them follow me -- then fry them with the sunlamp while the rest of you beat it to the sheriff’s station.",
      "DENISE: Everything we’ve built. Nobody’ll know what happened. They’ll think it was some horrible accident.\nLUCY: Next year they’ll take out Point Hope. Or Wainwright."
    ]
  },
